# ❌ Clearance height 8.50 m < 9.10 m (sh:expression minExclusive).
@prefix def:  <https://example.org/def/> .
@prefix eb:   <https://example.org/id/example-bridge/> .
@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
eb:LowBridge a def:NavigableBridge ;
    def:clearanceHeight [ a qudt:QuantityValue ; qudt:numericValue "8.50"^^xsd:decimal ] .
